1
00:00:00,008 --> 00:00:01,618
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,020
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,189 --> 00:00:04,909
(Episode 81)

4
00:00:07,525 --> 00:00:09,450
Perfect. I was craving something sweet.

5
00:00:09,644 --> 00:00:11,458
How thoughtful of you.

6
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,689
Thank you, ma'am.

7
00:00:14,191 --> 00:00:15,191
Go ahead and eat.

8
00:00:15,448 --> 00:00:16,448
Okay.

9
00:00:18,751 --> 00:00:21,473
Why so quiet? Say something.

10
00:00:24,418 --> 00:00:26,829
Mother, happy birthday.

11
00:00:27,665 --> 00:00:29,995
I thought carefully about what to get you.

12
00:00:34,045 --> 00:00:35,150
Here you are.

13
00:00:37,254 --> 00:00:38,394
Well, thank you.

14
00:00:41,651 --> 00:00:44,137
Goodness. Why is it so big?

15
00:00:47,118 --> 00:00:49,234
You went for value, didn't you?

16
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:52,154
- Is that supposed to be me?
- Apparently.

17
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:53,806
Is that really you?

18
00:00:54,129 --> 00:00:56,118
Is my wife really this beautiful?

19
00:00:57,713 --> 00:00:58,852
Of course.

20
00:00:58,932 --> 00:01:00,890
You're so elegant and classy,

21
00:01:00,931 --> 00:01:02,398
and absolutely beautiful.

22
00:01:03,638 --> 00:01:05,511
You said the same thing to me.

23
00:01:05,645 --> 00:01:07,510
Do you rehearse those lines?

24
00:01:08,949 --> 00:01:10,340
You caught me.

25
00:01:10,745 --> 00:01:13,768
Ma'am, I'd better leave
before I give away all my secrets.

26
00:01:13,898 --> 00:01:16,152
I only came to bring you the cake.

27
00:01:16,726 --> 00:01:17,952
Se Ri.

28
00:01:18,145 --> 00:01:21,051
Jung A is my guest.
Why are you making her uncomfortable?

29
00:01:22,215 --> 00:01:24,295
No, I was about to leave.

30
00:01:24,998 --> 00:01:27,092
Mom said staying too long as a guest...

31
00:01:27,093 --> 00:01:28,750
is bad manners.

32
00:01:28,995 --> 00:01:30,423
I really enjoyed the meal.

33
00:01:31,138 --> 00:01:32,531
I'm heading out, Ji Ni.

34
00:01:32,911 --> 00:01:34,131
Ma'am, see you next time.

35
00:01:34,298 --> 00:01:35,829
Bye, Ji Hu.

36
00:01:36,701 --> 00:01:37,958
Okay. Bye, Jung A.

37
00:01:37,959 --> 00:01:39,559
- Goodbye.
- Bye.

38
00:01:42,992 --> 00:01:45,115
Take care. Thanks for today.

39
00:01:46,052 --> 00:01:47,432
Keep your spirits up...

40
00:01:47,685 --> 00:01:48,885
and try to smile a little.

41
00:01:49,715 --> 00:01:51,141
- I'll get going.
- Bye.

42
00:01:57,772 --> 00:02:00,477
You've captured the expression
and every fine detail so well.

43
00:02:00,684 --> 00:02:02,290
Amazing work, Ji Ni.

44
00:02:02,291 --> 00:02:04,200
Her paintings made me fall for her.

45
00:02:05,852 --> 00:02:09,625
I hope you'll look kindly on Ji Ni.

46
00:02:09,627 --> 00:02:11,741
She doesn't talk much,

47
00:02:11,743 --> 00:02:13,931
but she's considerate and genuine.

48
00:02:15,932 --> 00:02:17,405
Your ring...

49
00:02:18,386 --> 00:02:19,772
You mean this?

50
00:02:21,432 --> 00:02:23,001
Ji Hu...

51
00:02:23,452 --> 00:02:27,222
said everyone had a ring but me,
so he bought me one.

52
00:02:27,778 --> 00:02:30,332
Apart from my husband,

53
00:02:30,334 --> 00:02:31,986
you're the first to buy me a ring, Ji Hu.

54
00:02:34,740 --> 00:02:35,811
You did well.

55
00:02:36,445 --> 00:02:38,588
Take care of her
as you would your own mother.

56
00:02:38,809 --> 00:02:39,809
Of course.

57
00:02:40,313 --> 00:02:42,617
- Mom, you should go.
- Okay.

58
00:02:42,618 --> 00:02:45,821
- Do you need anything else, Mother?
- No.

59
00:02:46,798 --> 00:02:48,187
I need Jung A around.

60
00:02:48,498 --> 00:02:50,351
I love spending time with her.

61
00:02:51,394 --> 00:02:52,570
I'm tired.

62
00:02:54,778 --> 00:02:55,904
Goodbye, Se Ri.

63
00:02:55,905 --> 00:02:58,238
Goodbye. As for the gift...

64
00:03:00,215 --> 00:03:02,064
Just leave it anywhere.

65
00:03:03,125 --> 00:03:04,325
I'll go to my room.

66
00:03:05,472 --> 00:03:06,736
I'll hang it somewhere nice.

67
00:03:06,922 --> 00:03:08,446
Let me take you home, Mother.

68
00:03:09,025 --> 00:03:10,338
No, I'll do it.

69
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:12,040
I'll give you a ride home, Se Ri.

70
00:03:12,118 --> 00:03:14,051
- You must be tired.
- Okay.

71
00:03:14,490 --> 00:03:15,490
Let's go.

72
00:03:15,914 --> 00:03:17,691
No need to come out.

73
00:03:18,225 --> 00:03:21,011
- Rest up. See you.
- Bye.

74
00:03:24,565 --> 00:03:25,745
Goodbye.

75
00:03:31,678 --> 00:03:34,520
You really did a great job, Ji Ni.

76
00:03:35,005 --> 00:03:36,438
Draw my portrait next time.

77
00:03:37,572 --> 00:03:38,572
Okay.

78
00:03:40,216 --> 00:03:41,772
Don't lose confidence.

79
00:03:42,018 --> 00:03:44,038
I used to walk on eggshells too,

80
00:03:44,145 --> 00:03:45,859
but now I just let her do her thing.

81
00:03:46,958 --> 00:03:49,591
You don't have to worry
about what she thinks.

82
00:03:49,958 --> 00:03:52,313
My mom's decided not to worry either.

83
00:03:53,225 --> 00:03:55,548
But I'm stuck in the middle.

84
00:03:56,952 --> 00:04:00,015
It takes time. Just keep trying.

85
00:04:00,243 --> 00:04:01,495
You have my support.

86
00:04:02,365 --> 00:04:04,104
Okay. I'll work up the courage.

87
00:04:05,152 --> 00:04:07,045
I'm back. What's this?

88
00:04:07,125 --> 00:04:08,495
The birthday party hasn't started?

89
00:04:08,496 --> 00:04:10,872
It's over. What took you so long?

90
00:04:11,402 --> 00:04:12,536
- You're back.
- Yes.

91
00:04:12,725 --> 00:04:14,885
What else would I be doing?
I finished work...

92
00:04:14,886 --> 00:04:17,647
and rushed out to buy a birthday gift
at the department store.

93
00:04:17,874 --> 00:04:20,273
I rushed here, and it's already over?

94
00:04:20,407 --> 00:04:21,726
Seriously...

95
00:04:21,791 --> 00:04:24,811
All three have the same design,

96
00:04:25,618 --> 00:04:28,623
but this color is the nicest.

97
00:04:28,625 --> 00:04:30,628
So this one's for you, Yeong Ju.

98
00:04:31,485 --> 00:04:32,485
Why me...

99
00:04:33,438 --> 00:04:36,166
One each for the two birthday ladies,
and one for Yeong Ju.

100
00:04:36,317 --> 00:04:37,317
I'm proud of myself.

101
00:04:38,701 --> 00:04:41,028
How much is this?

102
00:04:42,690 --> 00:04:43,690
Th...

103
00:04:44,337 --> 00:04:45,337
Thirty thousand?

104
00:04:47,992 --> 00:04:50,434
Thirty thousand dollars for one bag?

105
00:04:51,945 --> 00:04:53,175
So all of these together...

106
00:04:54,209 --> 00:04:55,209
A hundred thousand?

107
00:04:56,192 --> 00:04:58,162
It's a bag that'll last a lifetime.

108
00:05:06,981 --> 00:05:09,069
Why are you scolding me again?

109
00:05:09,412 --> 00:05:12,711
It's Sun Kyung's first birthday
since we got married.

110
00:05:13,457 --> 00:05:16,965
Can't I buy her a bag
that'll last a lifetime?

111
00:05:17,472 --> 00:05:19,513
I upset her so much over our marriage.

112
00:05:20,198 --> 00:05:23,178
And the Maestro is family now too.

113
00:05:23,598 --> 00:05:26,530
I feel for her. It's her first birthday
without her husband.

114
00:05:26,532 --> 00:05:29,157
Always an excuse. And me?

115
00:05:29,251 --> 00:05:30,779
Why did you buy me one?

116
00:05:31,168 --> 00:05:32,723
Because it's you, Yeong Ju.

117
00:05:33,072 --> 00:05:34,838
What better reason could there be?

118
00:05:35,118 --> 00:05:37,906
You kept telling me not to buy things
when we got married.

119
00:05:38,161 --> 00:05:41,238
You barely let me buy anything.

120
00:05:41,325 --> 00:05:43,103
If you exclude the unpaid bills,

121
00:05:43,117 --> 00:05:45,213
the clinic barely broke even this month.

122
00:05:46,338 --> 00:05:49,515
Are you spending money from your loan?
The hundred thousand dollars?

123
00:05:49,692 --> 00:05:50,982
What's wrong with that?

124
00:05:51,756 --> 00:05:53,404
Not everyone can get a loan.

125
00:05:58,085 --> 00:06:02,529
Yeong Ju, if we keep this up,
we'll end up having a real fight.

126
00:06:02,677 --> 00:06:03,951
Exactly.

127
00:06:04,132 --> 00:06:05,819
I'm scared now too.

128
00:06:06,192 --> 00:06:09,783
I can't tell which of us
is being unreasonable.

129
00:06:09,785 --> 00:06:11,690
You're the one being unreasonable.

130
00:06:11,692 --> 00:06:13,264
When we got married, I promised...

131
00:06:13,358 --> 00:06:15,997
to spoil you with beautiful things.

132
00:06:16,332 --> 00:06:17,740
I haven't changed.

133
00:06:18,698 --> 00:06:19,978
Yeong Ju, you need to change.

134
00:06:28,272 --> 00:06:29,272
Thank you.

135
00:06:30,330 --> 00:06:31,836
Today wasn't easy for you, was it?

136
00:06:32,338 --> 00:06:34,295
You said parents should...

137
00:06:34,416 --> 00:06:36,355
help their children feel comfortable.

138
00:06:37,485 --> 00:06:39,656
Ji Ni feels on edge because of me.

139
00:06:39,658 --> 00:06:41,611
Please be patient with her.

140
00:06:41,724 --> 00:06:43,434
I understand. I'll take care of her.

141
00:06:43,742 --> 00:06:44,900
Thank you.

142
00:06:45,639 --> 00:06:48,554
You should head back.
Thanks for the comfortable ride.

143
00:06:48,761 --> 00:06:49,897
It was nothing.

144
00:06:50,145 --> 00:06:52,305
About the 200,000 dollars...

145
00:06:53,250 --> 00:06:55,903
It's a lot of money, I know. I'll...

146
00:06:55,915 --> 00:06:57,971
No. I'll send it to you tomorrow.

147
00:06:59,791 --> 00:07:02,232
- Really?
- Don't worry. Get a good night's sleep.

148
00:07:04,700 --> 00:07:07,880
Thank you. I'll repay your kindness.

149
00:07:08,502 --> 00:07:10,345
- I'll get going.
- Okay.

150
00:07:21,571 --> 00:07:24,501
- You're going to lend Na Se Ri money?
- Quiet.

151
00:07:25,714 --> 00:07:26,856
It's a secret.

152
00:07:29,085 --> 00:07:30,085
Okay.

153
00:07:30,633 --> 00:07:34,578
She looks just as anxious
as my wife used to.

154
00:07:34,824 --> 00:07:35,824
Used to...

155
00:07:39,253 --> 00:07:40,597
But still, General...

156
00:07:40,885 --> 00:07:43,730
You're uncomfortable around her, right?

157
00:07:44,122 --> 00:07:45,122
I understand.

158
00:07:45,172 --> 00:07:46,911
I'll get someone else.

159
00:07:47,264 --> 00:07:48,264
No, General.

160
00:07:48,445 --> 00:07:49,946
My sister puts up with the situation,

161
00:07:50,112 --> 00:07:52,008
so what good would my anger do?

162
00:07:52,685 --> 00:07:53,685
But...

163
00:07:54,705 --> 00:07:56,230
please don't help her.

164
00:07:56,232 --> 00:07:58,026
She's not worth it.

165
00:08:00,729 --> 00:08:01,885
Understood.

166
00:08:02,102 --> 00:08:05,209
I'll see her as Ji Hu's mother-in-law.

167
00:08:05,845 --> 00:08:07,286
I'd appreciate that.

168
00:08:08,097 --> 00:08:10,678
Starting tomorrow, follow Se Ri...

169
00:08:11,152 --> 00:08:13,815
I mean, Ji Hu's mother-in-law.
Find out who that man is.

170
00:08:14,025 --> 00:08:16,537
She said it was urgent,
so we should find out soon.

171
00:08:16,804 --> 00:08:17,804
Yes, sir.

172
00:08:52,358 --> 00:08:55,383
Dinner with the two women I love most.

173
00:08:55,591 --> 00:08:56,805
At this very moment,

174
00:08:57,119 --> 00:09:00,370
I'm the happiest man in the world.

175
00:09:02,025 --> 00:09:05,535
Honey, we have to live to be 100.

176
00:09:05,702 --> 00:09:06,790
Of course.

177
00:09:10,258 --> 00:09:11,869
Yeah, right. Like we'll live to 100.

178
00:09:13,557 --> 00:09:15,777
Yeong Ju has her husband by her side,

179
00:09:15,998 --> 00:09:18,805
and Sun Kyung has hers,
looking all dignified.

180
00:09:19,152 --> 00:09:21,633
I'm the only one
with no money and no husband.

181
00:09:26,112 --> 00:09:27,492
Is this what punishment looks like?

182
00:09:27,758 --> 00:09:29,247
The punishment you talked about?

183
00:09:29,531 --> 00:09:31,419
Am I really being punished?

184
00:09:31,892 --> 00:09:33,193
I told you not to say that.

185
00:09:33,494 --> 00:09:34,985
What punishment?

186
00:09:35,138 --> 00:09:36,978
Yeah, one family was broken apart.

187
00:09:37,038 --> 00:09:39,010
But another family came together.

188
00:09:39,024 --> 00:09:40,485
So it evens out.

189
00:09:41,572 --> 00:09:42,818
That's right. It does.

190
00:09:44,011 --> 00:09:46,512
Just focus on us now.

191
00:09:47,238 --> 00:09:51,638
You, me, and Ji Ni.

192
00:10:03,305 --> 00:10:06,664
I really hate calling it punishment.

193
00:10:34,332 --> 00:10:36,376
Count it. It's 200,000 dollars.

194
00:10:36,819 --> 00:10:38,110
All in cash.

195
00:10:49,485 --> 00:10:52,615
You're something else, ma'am.
You're the best.

196
00:10:53,685 --> 00:10:56,638
Take the money and get lost
before I bite that thumb off!

197
00:10:56,658 --> 00:10:59,045
- Ma'am.
- I'm sick and tired...

198
00:10:59,139 --> 00:11:00,477
of you calling me that.

199
00:11:01,555 --> 00:11:02,555
We're done, right?

200
00:11:02,758 --> 00:11:05,618
This ends 25 years of bad blood.

201
00:11:07,432 --> 00:11:10,885
I'll pay for the foolish things
I did back then.

202
00:11:10,905 --> 00:11:13,058
It tears me apart,

203
00:11:13,159 --> 00:11:14,745
but I'll take my punishment.

204
00:11:15,419 --> 00:11:17,112
You're being a bit dramatic.

205
00:11:18,051 --> 00:11:20,225
Don't even say hello if we cross paths.

206
00:11:20,845 --> 00:11:22,763
I'll pay this money back and die in peace.

207
00:11:24,024 --> 00:11:25,136
You have to pay it back?

208
00:11:25,658 --> 00:11:27,313
Of course. Who else would?

209
00:11:27,912 --> 00:11:29,901
I'll sell my organs or whatever it takes.

210
00:11:29,994 --> 00:11:31,972
I'll pay it back, then die quietly,

211
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,664
so don't give me another thought. Got it?

212
00:11:33,791 --> 00:11:34,791
And one more thing.

213
00:11:35,482 --> 00:11:37,983
If my daughter finds out, I'm telling you,

214
00:11:38,343 --> 00:11:39,978
we're both dead.

215
00:11:40,212 --> 00:11:42,223
I've got nothing left to live for.

216
00:11:42,224 --> 00:11:43,530
Do you understand?

217
00:11:44,588 --> 00:11:46,044
I said I got it!

218
00:11:47,032 --> 00:11:49,912
Why do you always come in here
yelling over a measly 200,000 dollars?

219
00:11:50,587 --> 00:11:51,695
Measly?

220
00:11:52,692 --> 00:11:55,081
Would 200,000 dollars be too much
for someone with a broken leg?

221
00:11:55,591 --> 00:11:57,699
You'd pay 2,000,000 dollars
to keep your leg from being broken,

222
00:11:58,882 --> 00:11:59,882
wouldn't you?

223
00:12:00,417 --> 00:12:01,417
You're right.

224
00:12:01,678 --> 00:12:04,051
That's why I'm paying for what I did.

225
00:12:05,718 --> 00:12:08,640
We're in this together. Let's get along.

226
00:12:08,995 --> 00:12:10,205
Just promise me.

227
00:12:11,547 --> 00:12:13,243
Fine. I promise.

228
00:12:45,652 --> 00:12:46,883
Serves you right.

229
00:12:48,214 --> 00:12:51,380
You were so full of yourself
when you stole someone else's husband.

230
00:12:51,512 --> 00:12:52,758
Life was easy then, right?

231
00:13:15,445 --> 00:13:18,880
You can thank your sweet daughter
for getting the general involved.

232
00:13:26,118 --> 00:13:27,476
Excuse me.

233
00:13:30,022 --> 00:13:31,486
Busy, are you?

234
00:13:32,910 --> 00:13:33,910
What?

235
00:13:36,085 --> 00:13:37,246
Who are you?

236
00:13:37,325 --> 00:13:39,593
I'm not here to take
your grubby little money,

237
00:13:39,594 --> 00:13:41,118
so count it carefully.

238
00:13:47,258 --> 00:13:49,040
You've got the money as promised,

239
00:13:49,262 --> 00:13:51,562
so don't ever think
of threatening her again.

240
00:13:53,628 --> 00:13:55,536
Who do you think you are?

241
00:13:55,932 --> 00:13:57,380
Who are you?

242
00:13:59,551 --> 00:14:01,257
I was trying to be nice about this.

243
00:14:07,212 --> 00:14:08,746
- Hey, you punk!
- What?

244
00:14:09,132 --> 00:14:11,935
A man should keep his word. No excuses.

245
00:14:13,658 --> 00:14:15,903
Did you promise or not?

246
00:14:16,594 --> 00:14:18,051
I did.

247
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:20,649
I won't contact her again.

248
00:14:24,018 --> 00:14:25,018
Hand over your ID.

249
00:14:26,575 --> 00:14:27,575
My ID?

250
00:14:28,218 --> 00:14:29,872
- Hand it over.
- Yes.

251
00:14:36,008 --> 00:14:38,008
(Resident Registration Card, Lee Cheol)

252
00:14:39,548 --> 00:14:40,860
You're so young,

253
00:14:41,069 --> 00:14:43,274
yet you already live
like a piece of trash.

254
00:14:44,592 --> 00:14:45,592
I'm confiscating this.

255
00:14:46,438 --> 00:14:48,139
Why?

256
00:14:48,164 --> 00:14:49,625
Who do you think you are?

257
00:14:50,687 --> 00:14:51,687
Hey.

258
00:14:51,798 --> 00:14:54,288
We gave you 200,000 dollars
without even getting an IOU,

259
00:14:54,312 --> 00:14:56,128
and all I'm asking for is your ID.

260
00:14:56,525 --> 00:14:59,069
Who's being unreasonable here, you or me?

261
00:14:59,158 --> 00:15:00,466
You're really asking for it!

262
00:15:02,100 --> 00:15:03,100
Listen up!

263
00:15:03,965 --> 00:15:06,415
From now on, you won't even be alone
in the bathroom.

264
00:15:06,545 --> 00:15:08,492
I'll be keeping a close eye on you.

265
00:15:08,945 --> 00:15:11,034
If I catch you trying anything funny,

266
00:15:12,075 --> 00:15:14,544
you won't get to meet me
somewhere this nice again.

267
00:15:15,054 --> 00:15:16,054
Understand?

268
00:15:17,926 --> 00:15:19,399
I said, do you understand?

269
00:15:19,931 --> 00:15:21,954
Where on earth did you serve
in the military?

270
00:15:22,052 --> 00:15:23,213
Are you going to answer me or not?

271
00:15:23,896 --> 00:15:25,672
Okay.

272
00:15:26,038 --> 00:15:28,935
Looks like you never even served.

273
00:15:41,419 --> 00:15:42,716
I'll kill you!

274
00:16:01,511 --> 00:16:02,574
Hello.

275
00:16:03,945 --> 00:16:05,877
Hey, cafe guy.

276
00:16:06,627 --> 00:16:07,627
What brings you here?

277
00:16:07,630 --> 00:16:09,071
Have some.

278
00:16:10,405 --> 00:16:11,784
Is Seung Woo not here?

279
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:15,304
He stepped out for a meeting.
I can call him.

280
00:16:15,329 --> 00:16:17,827
I'm not here to see him.

281
00:16:18,281 --> 00:16:21,062
Ms. Song, I have a favor to ask you.

282
00:16:21,389 --> 00:16:22,389
Me?

283
00:16:22,632 --> 00:16:23,632
What is it?

284
00:16:28,930 --> 00:16:31,217
This student's photo is 25 years old.

285
00:16:31,241 --> 00:16:33,150
I wonder what he looks like now.

286
00:16:33,433 --> 00:16:36,313
I heard AI can predict
what someone might look like.

287
00:16:36,338 --> 00:16:39,780
There's a lot of that these days.
They even use it to find missing people.

288
00:16:39,951 --> 00:16:41,701
Could you recommend a company?

289
00:16:41,938 --> 00:16:42,938
Sure.

290
00:16:43,292 --> 00:16:45,160
Send me the photo on the messenger app.

291
00:16:45,239 --> 00:16:47,028
- Okay.
- Who is it, though?

292
00:16:47,158 --> 00:16:51,147
Director Cha would know more about this.
Why are you asking me?

293
00:16:51,172 --> 00:16:53,834
I'll tell you later.

294
00:16:54,065 --> 00:16:55,632
Nothing's certain yet.

295
00:16:55,633 --> 00:16:58,549
You brothers sure have a lot of secrets.

296
00:16:58,765 --> 00:17:00,819
Does Seung Woo have secrets from me too?

297
00:17:02,885 --> 00:17:05,236
I found it while emptying the trash.

298
00:17:05,261 --> 00:17:07,070
And the jerk didn't even tell me.

299
00:17:07,758 --> 00:17:10,678
He'd be in trouble
if you found out, right?

300
00:17:15,131 --> 00:17:17,821
Seung Hyun! When did you get here?

301
00:17:18,912 --> 00:17:20,378
Are you seeing Han Jeong Won again?

302
00:17:20,443 --> 00:17:22,143
Mind your own business.

303
00:17:22,168 --> 00:17:23,879
You're way too obsessed with me.

304
00:17:24,091 --> 00:17:25,499
Get a life of your own.

305
00:17:25,524 --> 00:17:27,247
Find yourself a decent woman.

306
00:17:27,272 --> 00:17:28,858
I'll live my own life too.

307
00:17:30,485 --> 00:17:32,023
That woman hasn't changed, has she?

308
00:17:33,252 --> 00:17:35,011
Is she out of her mind,
bringing you her resume?

309
00:17:36,365 --> 00:17:37,759
Let's not insult her.

310
00:17:42,131 --> 00:17:44,077
Mother, are you going to the store?

311
00:17:44,407 --> 00:17:45,407
Yeah.

312
00:17:46,265 --> 00:17:48,467
Mind if I come with you?

313
00:17:48,492 --> 00:17:49,981
I'm good at carrying heavy things.

314
00:17:50,184 --> 00:17:51,541
No, thanks.

315
00:17:52,512 --> 00:17:55,135
Mother, let me come with you. Okay?

316
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:57,737
What's gotten into you? I said no.

317
00:17:58,985 --> 00:18:01,321
If you didn't like yesterday's gift,

318
00:18:01,512 --> 00:18:04,007
- I can paint you another one.
- I said no.

319
00:18:04,299 --> 00:18:06,126
I'm not interested in paintings.

320
00:18:06,965 --> 00:18:11,788
You're so clueless. No wonder you ended up
living under the official wife's roof.

321
00:18:11,892 --> 00:18:15,130
If I were you, I'd live under a bridge
before setting foot in that house.

322
00:18:16,165 --> 00:18:18,064
Honestly,

323
00:18:18,594 --> 00:18:21,094
you and your mom are something else.

324
00:18:21,912 --> 00:18:23,644
And you still want
to marry into a family...

325
00:18:23,980 --> 00:18:25,724
where that official wife lives?

326
00:18:27,798 --> 00:18:29,705
I'm embarrassed to be seen with you.

327
00:18:30,559 --> 00:18:32,817
Stop trying so hard to win me over.

328
00:18:41,924 --> 00:18:43,217
It's okay.

329
00:18:44,875 --> 00:18:48,150
Things will get better with time.

330
00:18:57,547 --> 00:18:59,060
- Hello.
- Ji Ni,

331
00:18:59,170 --> 00:19:02,806
I'm going to the department store
with Sa Bin to return a bag.

332
00:19:02,985 --> 00:19:05,821
Then I realized I never got you
a wedding gift.

333
00:19:05,846 --> 00:19:07,394
No, you didn't have to.

334
00:19:07,419 --> 00:19:09,834
Don't worry about it.
I can't spend much anyway.

335
00:19:10,572 --> 00:19:14,241
I think you used to like taking pictures
when you were younger.

336
00:19:14,265 --> 00:19:15,265
Am I right?

337
00:19:15,732 --> 00:19:17,563
Yes, when I was a kid.

338
00:19:18,292 --> 00:19:20,607
I was thinking of getting you
a Polaroid camera.

339
00:19:20,772 --> 00:19:22,573
You could take pictures
when you go out with Ji Hu.

340
00:19:23,545 --> 00:19:24,696
Really?

341
00:19:25,208 --> 00:19:26,474
Thank you.

342
00:19:27,284 --> 00:19:29,508
Have you two made up?

343
00:19:29,681 --> 00:19:32,005
Not exactly. We reached a compromise.

344
00:19:32,472 --> 00:19:34,858
We agreed to check with each other
before spending a lot of money.

345
00:19:35,088 --> 00:19:36,382
I won, right?

346
00:19:37,043 --> 00:19:38,043
Right.

347
00:19:38,760 --> 00:19:40,173
Okay, got it.

348
00:19:59,911 --> 00:20:01,548
Found it!

349
00:20:42,127 --> 00:20:43,234
You're here.

350
00:20:43,726 --> 00:20:44,726
Jung A.

351
00:20:45,181 --> 00:20:46,370
Yes, ma'am!

352
00:20:47,285 --> 00:20:50,198
Ji Ni said she wanted to come along,
so I left her behind.

353
00:20:50,325 --> 00:20:52,013
I wanted some time alone with you.

354
00:20:54,747 --> 00:20:56,085
Have a seat.

355
00:20:56,967 --> 00:20:58,644
You run an art academy?

356
00:20:58,958 --> 00:21:00,248
With a senior from college.

357
00:21:00,541 --> 00:21:01,905
You must be busy.

358
00:21:02,573 --> 00:21:04,942
It's a little better now
that we've hired a part-time teacher.

359
00:21:06,010 --> 00:21:08,247
What about you? Do you have a boyfriend?

360
00:21:09,758 --> 00:21:10,843
No.

361
00:21:12,185 --> 00:21:13,997
I have really high standards.

362
00:21:14,805 --> 00:21:16,832
Every man I've ever liked...

363
00:21:17,222 --> 00:21:19,091
has already been taken.

364
00:21:19,684 --> 00:21:22,167
The good ones are always taken, you know.

365
00:21:23,112 --> 00:21:24,112
Really?

366
00:21:24,373 --> 00:21:27,059
Isn't Ji Hu good enough for you?

367
00:21:27,084 --> 00:21:30,032
He's definitely a catch.
Of course he's my type.

368
00:21:30,405 --> 00:21:32,417
That's why Ji Ni married him, I guess.

369
00:21:34,275 --> 00:21:36,249
Ji Ni's always been popular.

370
00:21:36,375 --> 00:21:38,878
Do you know how many times guys I liked...

371
00:21:38,879 --> 00:21:40,398
confessed to Ji Ni instead?

372
00:21:40,858 --> 00:21:43,324
Please don't bring up painful memories.

373
00:21:43,843 --> 00:21:45,058
You cutie.

374
00:21:45,278 --> 00:21:47,619
Why didn't you hold on to Ji Hu?

375
00:21:47,621 --> 00:21:49,119
I know, right?

376
00:21:51,398 --> 00:21:53,795
Ma'am, do you dislike Ji Ni?

377
00:21:55,451 --> 00:21:57,097
I don't like the mistress's daughter.

378
00:21:57,772 --> 00:21:59,826
I wish you were my daughter-in-law.

379
00:21:59,985 --> 00:22:01,969
Why would you say that?

380
00:22:02,071 --> 00:22:04,406
Ji Ni went through so much
before getting married.

381
00:22:04,476 --> 00:22:05,736
That's all the more reason I dislike her.

382
00:22:05,915 --> 00:22:07,693
I can't stand people
with complicated pasts.

383
00:22:08,192 --> 00:22:09,220
Ma'am...

384
00:22:10,094 --> 00:22:11,364
Please don't be like that.

385
00:22:11,477 --> 00:22:13,111
Ji Ni would be hurt if she heard you.

386
00:22:13,135 --> 00:22:14,677
I couldn't care less.

387
00:22:15,372 --> 00:22:17,415
I have no respect
for a mistress's daughter.

388
00:22:17,822 --> 00:22:19,878
But Ji Hu's dad supports Ji Ni too.

389
00:22:19,892 --> 00:22:22,281
That's because her mom
keeps throwing herself at him.

390
00:22:22,471 --> 00:22:25,306
She's been a mistress her whole life.

391
00:22:25,932 --> 00:22:28,420
The nerve of that woman, giving him
those flirtatious looks. So vulgar.

392
00:22:29,523 --> 00:22:33,548
And my son, who put a ring
on that woman's finger...

393
00:22:33,562 --> 00:22:35,308
It's humiliating. Honestly.

394
00:22:35,872 --> 00:22:38,328
I'll make sure to break them up one day.

395
00:22:39,605 --> 00:22:41,762
- What?
- I failed to stop the marriage,

396
00:22:41,786 --> 00:22:43,446
but I can make the divorce happen.

397
00:22:44,105 --> 00:22:45,715
A daughter-in-law isn't my own daughter.

398
00:22:46,045 --> 00:22:47,682
What's stopping me from replacing her?

399
00:22:49,425 --> 00:22:50,480
Please don't, ma'am.

400
00:22:50,540 --> 00:22:51,935
Please don't do this to Ji Ni.

401
00:22:54,129 --> 00:22:56,429
You sweet girl.

402
00:22:56,585 --> 00:22:58,198
Just stay out of it.

403
00:22:58,418 --> 00:23:01,633
Just sit back, enjoy the show,
and reap the benefits.

404
00:23:01,770 --> 00:23:02,880
Enjoy.

405
00:23:12,826 --> 00:23:14,269
- Hello, ma'am.
- Hey.

406
00:23:14,271 --> 00:23:15,973
Ji Hu isn't here right now.

407
00:23:16,932 --> 00:23:18,314
Hey, what are you doing here?

408
00:23:19,050 --> 00:23:20,050
Hi.

409
00:23:20,271 --> 00:23:21,324
Where's Ji Hu?

410
00:23:21,349 --> 00:23:23,632
His mother-in-law called,
so he stepped out.

411
00:23:23,656 --> 00:23:24,656
What?

412
00:23:24,925 --> 00:23:25,932
Where to?

413
00:23:25,956 --> 00:23:27,768
I'm not sure.

414
00:23:27,825 --> 00:23:29,102
I really don't know.

415
00:23:29,127 --> 00:23:32,399
She even took the ring he gave her.
Unbelievable.

416
00:23:33,222 --> 00:23:34,222
Jung A, let's go.

417
00:23:34,322 --> 00:23:35,322
Okay.

418
00:23:36,085 --> 00:23:37,085
Hey.

419
00:23:38,185 --> 00:23:40,314
What's with you?
Why are you going around with her?

420
00:23:40,610 --> 00:23:42,407
Well...

421
00:23:43,064 --> 00:23:44,715
It's a little awkward for me too.

422
00:23:44,827 --> 00:23:45,827
Anyway, bye.

423
00:23:46,050 --> 00:23:47,156
Goodbye.

424
00:23:50,465 --> 00:23:53,113
- Shouldn't she come with her son's wife?
- Exactly.

425
00:23:53,138 --> 00:23:55,720
Ji Ni should be the one in that position.

426
00:23:55,744 --> 00:23:56,812
Exactly.

427
00:24:02,138 --> 00:24:04,930
Good. Turn your face slightly.

428
00:24:04,955 --> 00:24:06,850
Now look straight ahead.

429
00:24:08,318 --> 00:24:10,290
Okay, give me a slight smile.

430
00:24:10,315 --> 00:24:12,137
Yes, look straight ahead.

431
00:24:13,378 --> 00:24:15,685
Good. Lower your chin just a little.

432
00:24:16,461 --> 00:24:17,768
Great. Smile.

433
00:24:18,705 --> 00:24:20,499
- Yes.
- Why aren't you here yet?

434
00:24:21,641 --> 00:24:22,833
Mom and Jung A?

435
00:24:23,518 --> 00:24:24,610
What's going on?

436
00:24:26,541 --> 00:24:27,743
Okay. I'll be right there.

437
00:24:27,913 --> 00:24:28,913
Sorry.

438
00:24:30,430 --> 00:24:32,990
Good. Lift your chin a little more.

439
00:24:33,014 --> 00:24:34,430
Perfect. Yes.

440
00:24:35,218 --> 00:24:36,851
Okay, that's a wrap.

441
00:24:37,495 --> 00:24:38,796
Great work.

442
00:24:38,821 --> 00:24:41,585
- Great work.
- Thank you.

443
00:24:45,218 --> 00:24:46,519
Is he your boyfriend?

444
00:24:46,729 --> 00:24:48,093
Boyfriend?

445
00:24:48,926 --> 00:24:50,096
He's my son-in-law.

446
00:24:50,121 --> 00:24:52,819
But you two look like a model couple.

447
00:24:53,091 --> 00:24:54,226
Why don't you take a photo together?

448
00:24:56,183 --> 00:24:58,431
- Should we?
- It's fine. Go ahead.

449
00:25:01,871 --> 00:25:03,832
Okay, here we go. One, two.

450
00:25:08,105 --> 00:25:10,208
- Have you been waiting long?
- Yes.

451
00:25:12,771 --> 00:25:13,885
What's that?

452
00:25:15,694 --> 00:25:16,717
Want some?

453
00:25:22,791 --> 00:25:23,913
Mother.

454
00:25:24,242 --> 00:25:26,866
I need a little of that to calm my nerves.

455
00:25:26,956 --> 00:25:28,327
Don't tell Ji Ni.

456
00:25:29,183 --> 00:25:31,279
Stop it. I'm not drinking.

457
00:25:31,918 --> 00:25:33,067
Is something wrong?

458
00:25:33,614 --> 00:25:34,867
What's making you anxious?

459
00:25:35,486 --> 00:25:37,369
I'm fine now. It's all over.

460
00:25:38,792 --> 00:25:41,290
Take good care of your dad.

461
00:25:41,712 --> 00:25:43,667
He's a truly wonderful man.

462
00:25:44,641 --> 00:25:46,753
You're truly blessed.

463
00:25:47,491 --> 00:25:49,141
I try to live with gratitude.

464
00:25:50,085 --> 00:25:51,705
Do you always go around alone like this?

465
00:25:51,832 --> 00:25:52,898
It must be inconvenient.

466
00:25:52,923 --> 00:25:55,228
Ms. Song usually comes with me,

467
00:25:55,325 --> 00:25:57,188
but today I wanted to see you.

468
00:25:57,648 --> 00:26:00,516
I feel reassured with you here.

469
00:26:01,800 --> 00:26:04,624
I don't know what's going on,
but please don't worry anymore.

470
00:26:04,732 --> 00:26:06,003
And Ji Ni is safe.

471
00:26:06,672 --> 00:26:09,799
All you need to do is stay healthy
and be with us.

472
00:26:10,725 --> 00:26:13,469
Mother, before it gets colder,
shall the three of us take a trip?

473
00:26:14,534 --> 00:26:16,608
I'd love that.

474
00:26:16,632 --> 00:26:18,743
I thought so.

475
00:26:21,166 --> 00:26:24,101
(Family Register, Self, Na Ji Ni)

476
00:26:28,718 --> 00:26:32,090
Honey, look at this. Isn't it great?

477
00:26:32,115 --> 00:26:35,142
Our dear Ji Ni is finally all set.

478
00:26:39,085 --> 00:26:40,922
- Mom.
- You scared me!

479
00:26:41,498 --> 00:26:44,185
What brings you here at dinnertime?

480
00:26:49,891 --> 00:26:51,046
Take a look at this.

481
00:26:53,725 --> 00:26:55,875
Mom, that day. The day of the accident.

482
00:26:57,252 --> 00:26:58,252
What?

483
00:26:58,255 --> 00:27:00,822
You saw it too, right?
The Pumseonggak motorcycle.

484
00:27:01,186 --> 00:27:02,186
What?

485
00:27:02,712 --> 00:27:05,318
If my camera caught it from the back,

486
00:27:05,342 --> 00:27:07,365
you must've seen it all
in your rearview mirror.

487
00:27:07,658 --> 00:27:09,937
Was this on your camera?

488
00:27:10,744 --> 00:27:13,043
Then why did you say you didn't see it?

489
00:27:13,792 --> 00:27:15,222
Were you always like this?

490
00:27:16,325 --> 00:27:17,939
You knew this family was looking for it,

491
00:27:18,121 --> 00:27:21,107
- so why didn't you say anything?
- What are you talking about?

492
00:27:21,312 --> 00:27:23,409
I really didn't see it.

493
00:27:23,545 --> 00:27:27,794
That cat suddenly darted out that day.
I was so startled.

494
00:27:27,891 --> 00:27:29,060
As for Seung Woo,

495
00:27:29,084 --> 00:27:31,553
he was chasing us but then disappeared,
so I thought he'd gone home.

496
00:27:31,578 --> 00:27:34,232
I only found out
about the accident afterward.

497
00:27:35,426 --> 00:27:36,913
- Is that true?
- Are you...

498
00:27:36,938 --> 00:27:38,699
accusing me of something?

499
00:27:38,872 --> 00:27:39,872
Seriously...

500
00:27:39,896 --> 00:27:41,648
They say children are no use at all.

501
00:27:42,145 --> 00:27:44,153
Yeong Ju put you up to this, didn't she?

502
00:27:44,238 --> 00:27:46,186
Did she tell you to come here
and investigate?

503
00:27:46,211 --> 00:27:48,159
- Mom.
- You...

504
00:27:48,429 --> 00:27:50,803
No matter how embarrassed you are by me
or how much you admire Yeong Ju,

505
00:27:50,828 --> 00:27:52,299
I'm the one who gave birth to you.

506
00:27:52,572 --> 00:27:55,924
I'm the one who endured all that
humiliation and carried you in my womb.

507
00:27:57,278 --> 00:27:58,638
You ungrateful brat.

508
00:27:58,732 --> 00:28:02,466
No matter what people say,
a child should stand up for her mom.

509
00:28:03,921 --> 00:28:05,938
I thought at least you'd be on my side.

510
00:28:06,338 --> 00:28:08,058
Stop changing the subject.

511
00:28:08,083 --> 00:28:09,571
Did you see it or not?

512
00:28:09,595 --> 00:28:10,811
Na Ji Ni!

513
00:28:35,959 --> 00:28:39,413
(Family Register)

514
00:28:39,415 --> 00:28:41,243
What gives you the right
to hold your head high?

515
00:28:41,268 --> 00:28:43,270
If I bow my head,
they'll just walk all over me.

516
00:28:43,295 --> 00:28:46,164
How did the interest suddenly go up
by 100,000 dollars in just one week?

517
00:28:46,190 --> 00:28:47,717
Don't take revenge with your own hands.

518
00:28:47,742 --> 00:28:50,111
- I'm holding back the urge to kill him.
- Am I the one being unreasonable?

519
00:28:50,136 --> 00:28:51,843
How many times have I even seen her?

520
00:28:51,868 --> 00:28:53,029
We agreed never to see each other again.

521
00:28:53,060 --> 00:28:55,142
I told you if you showed up again,
we'd both be dead, didn't I?

522
00:28:55,167 --> 00:28:57,686
Give me another 100,000 dollars.
Then I'll really say goodbye for good.

523
00:28:59,113 --> 00:29:01,113
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
